<%= @dispute.status.humanize %> — <%= render_money @dispute.amount_cents %> on <%= @event.name %>.

Reason:       <%= @dispute.reason_label %>
Response due: <%= @dispute.evidence_due_at&.strftime("%B %-d, %Y at %l:%M %p UTC") || "no deadline (early warning)" %>
Dispute:      <%= @dispute.stripe_dispute_id %>
Payment:      <%= @dispute.stripe_payment_intent_id %>

<% if @dispute.open? -%>
Fuime is the merchant of record, so this dispute is against Fuime LLC and Fuime
responds to it — not the founder. A dispute nobody answers by its deadline is
lost by default.

Respond in Stripe: <%= @stripe_url %>
<% elsif @dispute.won? -%>
Won. The reversal on <%= @event.name %>'s ledger has been backed out, so the
operator's payable is restored.
<% else -%>
Lost. The money has left Fuime's balance and the operator's payable stays reduced.
<% end -%>

All disputes: <%= @admin_url %>
